assessed(100,2019,[12,12,9,7,6,7,3,4,2,1.5],-10,-10,1945,'revisionist global biography of Hitler','Primary scholarly reviews disagree sharply over the Anglo-American emphasis and treatment of socialism. Record lower evidence confidence; the inspected dispute does not by itself settle a serious gate, and analytical treatment of Nazism is not endorsement.', 'Archival synthesis is substantial but central emphasis receives serious specialist challenge|Connects ideology, geopolitical rivalry, economy and military choices|Strategic misperception and comparative-power concerns transfer to other cases|A strong organizing thesis risks overweighting one causal strand|Length and thesis repetition reduce efficiency|Historical strategic questions persist despite interpretive controversy|Geostrategy fits indirectly; productive mechanisms remain secondary|Simms has relevant international-history scholarship, with disputed interpretation here|A clear thesis organizes the life but can constrain nuance|Firm causal language sometimes exceeds the disputed evidence', ['https://www.hachettebookgroup.com/titles/brendan-simms/hitler/9780465022373/','https://journals.ub.uni-heidelberg.de/index.php/frrec/article/download/73361/67050','https://academic.oup.com/ahr/article-abstract/126/1/403/6244122'],{confidence:'low',eligibilityConfidence:'low',themeNote:'T11 -10: political-figure biography. T12 -10: war and political power.',periodNote:'Central biography ends in 1945.',yearConfidence:'high'});
assessed(101,2015,[12,13,10,8,8,7,4,4,2.5,1.5],0,0,null,'economic argument about cognitive-skill spillovers','Team complementarities and institutional spillovers provide models. National correlations do not settle causal direction, so evidence is restrained; discussion of cognitive differences is not itself an extremist claim.', 'Correlations and experiments support hypotheses but national causal attribution is uncertain|Connects skills, savings, teamwork, cooperation and institutions|Complementarity and spillover models transfer across productive organizations|Explains plausible channels without uniquely identifying national effects|A focused thesis concentrates evidence and mechanism|Team complementarity remains useful if broad national claims weaken|Quantification and institutional productivity fit indirectly|Jones has relevant economic research on cooperation and human capital|Several channels build a clear cumulative argument|Clear prose occasionally compresses causal uncertainty', ['https://books.google.com/books?id=HdWLCgAAQBAJ','https://mason.gmu.edu/~gjonesb/HiveMindInfographic.pdf','https://mason.gmu.edu/~gjonesb/VitaJones.pdf'],{themeNote:'T11 0: comparative economic mechanisms, not minority or racial history. T12 0: productive cooperation and cognitive human capital are primary, with politics and finance as channels.',confidence:'moderate'});
assessed(102,1938,[17,8,9,6,8,9,2,4,3,2],-10,-10,1937,'eyewitness memoir of the Spanish Civil War','The memoir explains propaganda, factional conflict and divergence between experience and public claims. Political commitment does not replace the author’s explicit empirical self-correction.', 'Eyewitness testimony distinguishes personal observation from uncertain wider claims|Connects front-line experience, factions, propaganda and institutions|Epistemic caution and factional incentives transfer across conflicts|Explains organizational contradictions more than broad military causation|A compact firsthand narrative supports its political observations|Propaganda and ideological self-deception lessons remain durable|Strategic institutions fit indirectly; technical content is limited|Orwell supplies direct participant observation rather than complete military history|Personal chronology and analytic asides remain memorable|Exact plain prose preserves uncertainty and limits of knowledge', ['https://www.penguinrandomhouse.ca/books/277055/homage-to-catalonia-by-george-orwell/9781784879006','https://www.penguinrandomhouse.ca/books/388855/penguin-classics-homage-to-catalonia-by-george-orwell/9780141393025'],{themeNote:'T11 -10: a concentrated Spanish national conflict account. T12 -10: war and political factions.',periodNote:'Central eyewitness period is December 1936 to June 1937.',yearNote:'Original publication 1938; cited publisher listings are later editions.',yearConfidence:'moderate'});
assessed(103,2008,[12,13,9,7,5,5,4,3,2.5,1],-10,-10,null,'argument for energy and environmental reform','A green-revolution proposal is not an automatic veto under revised V5. Sweeping causal simplification and technology optimism reduce scores.', 'Reported examples support concerns but broad claims are selectively generalized|Connects energy, globalization, demand, technology and national policy|Energy-security and incentive framing offer reusable policy questions|Explains reinforcing pressures with limited quantitative causal testing|Long rhetorical repetition reduces information density|Physical pressures persist but branded revolution claims date|Energy technology fits, while environmental reform dominates|Friedman has reporting access rather than technical energy expertise|A repeated central frame makes the argument easy to follow|Slogans and sweeping labels reduce exactness', ['https://www.thomaslfriedman.com/hot-flat-and-crowded-2-0/','https://books.google.com/books?id=hMNXAAAAYAAJ'],{themeNote:'T11 -10: ecology and American renewal. T12 -10: national policy and reform politics are central to the energy argument.',yearNote:'Original 2008 publication; the author page describes the later expanded 2.0 edition and records 2008 original reviews.'});
