assessed(14,2002,[12,12,12,9,5,8,7,4,2,1],0,0,null,'computational account of complexity','Substantial reproducible cellular-automaton material survives its overstated claim of a new science. Retain with restrained evidence and density; speculative physics is not treated as established theory.', 'Reproducible examples are strong; general equivalence and physics claims are weakly established|Connects computation, patterns, biology and physical modeling unevenly|Simple-rule exploration and irreducibility offer reusable modeling perspectives|Explicit automata mechanisms exceed the support for universal extrapolation|Large visual catalog and repetition make the length costly|Computational experiments endure independently of revolutionary publicity|Directly engages computation, physics and complex-system modeling|Wolfram’s computational expertise coexists with strong specialist criticism|Visual progression aids intuition but immense notes disrupt navigation|Idiosyncratic terminology weakens precision and scholarly comparison', ['https://wolframscience.com/nks/','https://wolframscience.com/nks/programs/','https://physicstoday.aip.org/reviews/a-new-kind-of-science','https://bactra.org/reviews/wolfram/'],{eligibilityConfidence:'moderate',reason:'The narrative experiment-driven argument passes the expert-exposition exception. Specialist criticism materially reduces scores, but the book’s enduring automata experiments are not primarily dependent on accepting its revolutionary claim.'});
assessed(15,2019,[17,12,9,8,7,8,3,5,2.5,1.5],-10,-10,1799,'history of the French Revolution','Institutional breakdown and revolutionary coalitions supply transferable lessons despite a central national-political subject.', 'Historian synthesizes established research with multiple social perspectives|Connects fiscal crisis, institutions, social change and political violence|Coalition shifts and institutional fragility transfer across revolutions|Explains interacting pressures without a single-factor revolution theory|Large narrative earns much of its length through contextual evidence|Foundational revolutionary institutions remain historically important|Political history dominates over technology and production|Popkin has specialist standing in revolutionary France|Chronological arc coordinates several social scales|Controlled historical prose sustains qualification', ['https://www.hachettebookgroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/BasicBooks-catalog-F19.pdf'],{themeNote:'T11 -10: single-nation history. T12 -10: revolution and politics are the central subject.',periodNote:'The revolutionary narrative is assessed through the 1799 end of the revolutionary decade; moderate endpoint confidence.'});
assessed(16,1994,[16,13,11,9,8,8,3,4,2.5,1.5],-10,-10,1993,'history of consumer-finance innovation','Useful institutional and product-innovation mechanisms survive the American finance focus and historical age.', 'Reported business histories substantiate changes in financial products|Connects banking regulation, consumer behavior, markets and technology|Distribution innovation and regulatory adaptation transfer beyond finance|Shows how new instruments changed access and institutional incentives|Cases advance a coherent change in household financial access|Mechanisms remain useful after specific products have matured|Finance is central, with technology as an enabling layer|Nocera brings sustained business-reporting access|A product-centered historical sequence is cumulative|Financial processes are explained in clear ordinary language', ['https://www.simonandschuster.com/books/A-Piece-of-the-Action/Joe-Nocera/9781476744896'],{themeNote:'T11 -10: American consumer-finance history. T12 -10: finance is central.',periodNote:'Central sequence reaches early-1990s consumer finance; 1993 is a moderate-confidence endpoint before the 1994 original publication.'});
assessed(17,2020,[15,12,9,7,6,7,2,4,2.5,2],-10,-10,2011,'presidential memoir','First-hand decision constraints and institutional bargaining supply a payload; a political memoir is not automatically V3 or ideological capture.', 'Participant access is rich but retrospective self-selection limits independence|Connects campaigns, government, crisis economics and foreign affairs|Decision tradeoffs and coalition management transfer beyond the administration|Explains constraints while often foregrounding personal judgment|Extensive personal and political detail reduces analytical density|Institutional dilemmas outlast the contemporary political cycle|Direct technical and industrial content remains secondary|Obama has unique executive access rather than neutral historical distance|A sustained presidency narrative is carefully structured|Prose is controlled and attentive to ambiguity', ['https://www.penguinrandomhouse.com/books/562882/a-promised-land-by-barack-obama/9781524763183/'],{themeNote:'T11 -10: American political-figure memoir. T12 -10: governing and political power are central.',periodNote:'This volume’s presidency narrative ends in 2011, including the bin Laden operation.'});
assessed(19,2021,[14,11,11,9,8,7,6,4,2.5,1.5],0,0,null,'theory of cortical intelligence','Reference-frame theory offers a concrete model; broad AI extrapolations remain hypotheses and lower confidence rather than trigger a prediction veto.', 'Research-informed proposal has empirical hooks but incomplete independent confirmation|Links neuroscience, spatial representation and machine intelligence|Reference-frame thinking offers reusable computational hypotheses|Explains a proposed architecture instead of only recounting discoveries|Core theory is compact, with more speculative later discussion|A testable model has value even if parts are revised|Neural computation and AI fit the requested interests|Hawkins has relevant applied computing and neuroscience research experience|A central theory gives the explanation a clear through-line|Accessible terminology occasionally simplifies unresolved biology', ['https://www.hachettebookgroup.com/titles/jeff-hawkins/a-thousand-brains/9781541675797/']);
assessed(20,2012,[15,11,10,8,8,7,3,4,2.5,1.5],0,0,null,'comparative account of education systems','Country comparisons give institutional lessons beyond a classroom manual. Reforms are not an ideological veto.', 'Comparative policy cases support the account without isolating every causal factor|Links teacher quality, institutions, standards and national development|System-design comparisons offer transferable organizational lessons|Shows coherent institutional packages rather than isolated classroom tips|Focused national cases carry distinct explanatory roles|Long-lived institutional patterns outlast individual reform programs|Education organization fits indirectly through human-capital development|Stewart has relevant international education-policy experience|Comparative chapters keep the reform argument organized|Clear policy exposition avoids excessive technical terminology', ['https://files.ascd.org/pdfs/publications/books/stewart2012_copyright.pdf','https://eric.ed.gov/?id=ED529506'],{themeNote:'T11 0: comparative international systems, not predominantly one nation’s history. T12 0: educational quality and organizational design dominate over political power.'});
assessed(21,2011,[16,9,9,8,8,7,2,4,2,1.5],-10,0,null,'empirical study of undergraduate learning','A test-based institutional argument with genuine evidence; sample and measurement limits reduce scope, not eligibility.', 'Longitudinal student data support findings, with restricted learning measures|Connects student effort, campus incentives and educational outcomes|Measurement and institutional-incentive lessons transfer to other services|Links low study demands to outcomes while causal identification remains partial|A focused empirical argument justifies its compact length|Incentive and measurement concerns persist beyond the studied cohorts|Little direct technology or industrial content|Authors contribute relevant sociology-of-education research|Findings and implications follow a readable sequence|Generally precise, though headline generalization is broader than measures', ['https://pressblog.uchicago.edu/2011/01/18/academically-adrift-on-the-web.html','https://storage.googleapis.com/gse-website-archive/collegepuzzle/collegepuzzle.stanford.edu/2011/08/index.html'],{author:'Richard Arum and Josipa Roksa',themeNote:'T11 -10: American higher-education institutions are central in both evidence and intended reform. T12 0: learning quality, not political power, is central.'});
assessed(22,2018,[14,6,7,5,7,7,1,4,2.5,1.5],0,-10,null,'reflective account of mortality and care','The main form is a sustained meditation informed by nursing, with practical observations rather than a technical treatment protocol. Mortality reflection has modest transferable decision value.', 'Nursing experience supports observations but the account is not outcome research|Connects personal, family and care institutions at a limited scale|Helps distinguish decisions, wishes and constraints under mortality|Explains interpersonal patterns more than biological causal mechanisms|Focused reflection limits padding despite anecdotal passages|Mortality and care dilemmas are durable|Little direct fit to industrial or quantitative domains|Tisdale has relevant nursing practice and literary experience|Reflective chapters combine personal scenes with coherent questions|Careful prose preserves emotional and factual distinctions', ['https://www.simonandschuster.com/books/Advice-for-Future-Corpses-%28and-Those-Who-Love-Them%29/Sallie-Tisdale/9781501182181'],{themeNote:'T11 0: general mortality and caregiving, not predominantly a particular disease or national history. T12 -10: practical philosophy of dying is central.',eligibilityConfidence:'moderate'});
assessed(23,2007,[16,9,7,6,8,8,1,4,2,1.5],0,-10,null,'intellectual exposition of Kojève','Analytical exposition of philosophical arguments passes the narrative exception; its narrow practical fit is scored.', 'Close interpretation of major writings supports the intellectual portrait|Connects philosophy, history, law and political interpretation|Recognition and historical-end-state concepts offer limited reusable frames|Explains conceptual relationships more than empirical causal mechanisms|A short treatment concentrates on the central ideas|Philosophical arguments remain available for critique over time|Little direct scientific, industrial or quantitative content|Nichols has relevant political-philosophy scholarship|Thematic exposition is readable but assumes philosophical interest|Concepts are treated with scholarly care', ['https://www.bloomsbury.com/us/alexandre-kojeve-9780742527775/'],{themeNote:'T11 0: intellectual argument rather than predominantly national history. T12 -10: philosophy is central.'});
assessed(24,2012,[11,8,9,6,6,6,2,3,2,1],0,0,null,'business-culture argument with organizational cases','General culture analysis and cases supply a modest payload. The seven-step advice does not make this a specific operational manual; causal claims remain weakly tested.', 'Survey and consulting cases support associations more than causation|Connects leadership, employee engagement and business performance|Culture alignment and feedback ideas transfer across organizations|Mechanisms are plausible but competing explanations receive limited testing|Motivational examples and repeated prescriptions reduce density|Broad organizational ideas endure better than branded formulas|Organizational quality fits indirectly, without technical systems detail|Authors have consulting access but limited independent validation here|A seven-part framework makes the argument easy to follow|Business slogans weaken precision', ['https://www.simonandschuster.com/books/All-In/Adrian-Gostick/9781451659825'],{author:'Adrian Gostick and Chester Elton',eligibilityConfidence:'moderate'});
assessed(25,2005,[11,8,9,6,7,7,2,3,2.5,1],0,0,null,'argument about marketing stories and consumer belief','The excerpt distinguishes coherent stories from fraudulent marketing. Persuasion models supply a payload without establishing systematic ideological or epistemic failure.', 'Selected marketing examples illustrate claims without controlled validation|Links consumer worldviews, storytelling and business communication|Audience framing and consistency offer transferable communication heuristics|Explains belief filters and reinforcement at a qualitative level|A compact argument contains some repeated promotional framing|Story interpretation remains useful despite changing media platforms|Limited fit to technical and industrial mechanisms|Godin contributes marketing practice rather than scientific testing|Provocative premise and short examples keep the structure clear|Rhetorical exaggeration reduces analytical exactness', ['https://seths.blog/wp-content/uploads/2005/03/Liarsexcerpt.pdf'],{themeNote:'T11 0: not predominantly an unwanted historical or identity theme. T12 0: marketing communication, rather than media institutions or political power, is central.'});
assessed(26,2018,[17,11,9,8,8,8,2,4,2.5,1.5],-10,-10,null,'investigation of private prisons','Undercover observation and institutional history explain incentives; the civil-reform stance is not itself a veto.', 'Direct undercover reporting is supported by institutional historical context|Connects prison labor, contracting, staffing, profit and state authority|Contract and oversight failures transfer beyond incarceration|Shows how incentives and staffing constraints shape treatment|Reported scenes carry substantial institutional evidence|Privatization and accountability problems remain durable|Institutional power fits; technical domains are secondary|Bauer brings direct investigative access and documentary reporting|Personal scenes and historical sections sustain a clear argument|Concrete reporting generally keeps claims distinct from interpretation', ['https://www.penguinrandomhouse.com/books/553182/american-prison-by-shane-bauer/9780735223608/'],{themeNote:'T11 -10: American incarceration and racial history. T12 -10: state coercion and institutional power are central.',periodNote:'The book combines a contemporary undercover investigation with a long institutional history; no single historical endpoint controls the account.'});
